# Tahti — agent project context

## Entry points

1. Root **`AGENTS.md`** — short map for every session.
2. **`docs/CONSTITUTION.md`** overrides everything else.
3. **`docs/AGENT.md`** — stack, milestones, data model, anti-patterns.
4. **`docs/remaining-work.md`** — collective incomplete checklist (do not invent a parallel backlog).
5. **`docs/project-roadmap.md`** — authoritative `[x]` / `[~]` / `[ ]` status.
6. **`docs/features.md`** — current product surface; **`docs/testing.md`** — how to verify.

## Non-negotiables for code work

- UI: `@tahti/ui` only (see `ui-library.mdc`).
- Marketing `website/`: off limits unless the user explicitly asks (`website-off-limits.mdc`).
- Before finish: `pnpm lint` + `pnpm format:check` (or `pnpm ci:check`); see `ci-lint-before-done.mdc`.
- Streaming: MinIO for HLS, separate recorder, Prometheus on stream containers — see `docs/technical/streaming-architecture.md`.

## Clients

- Production app: `apps/web` (this repo).
- Nuclear beta: separate repo; cutover docs in `ops/nuclear-web-cutover.md` — do not flip prod without that checklist.
